## Technical Implementation Standards

### 1. Frontend Auto-Derived Context Banner Pattern
For all child forms, replace duplicate comboboxes with this standard UI chip component/layout:
```html
<div class="col-span-12 flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
  <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 dark:bg-blue-900/40 dark:text-blue-300">
    <i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill me-1"></i> {{ 'TRACEABILITY_INHERITED' | translate }}
  </span>
  <div class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
    {{ 'PROJECT' | translate }}: <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">{{ projectName }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
    | {{ 'CUSTOMER' | translate }}: <span class="font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">{{ customerName }}</span>
  </div>
</div>
```

### 2. Backend Fallback Standard (Spring Boot)
In every child service `save()` / `create()` method:
```java
if (entity.getProjectId() == null && entity.getRequirementId() != null) {
    PmRequirement req = pmRequirementRepository.findById(entity.getRequirementId()).orElse(null);
    if (req != null) {
        entity.setProjectId(req.getProjectId());
        entity.setBusinessId(req.getBusinessId());
    }
}
```

